<BaseLayout title="About" description="Learn about DogeKing — your ultimate guide to meme coin trading on Solana.">
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-4 py-12">
    <h1 class="font-heading text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-white mb-6">About DogeKing</h1>
    <div class="prose prose-invert prose-gray max-w-none">
      <p>Welcome to <strong>DogeKing</strong> — your complete guide to meme coin trading on the Solana blockchain.</p>
      <h2>What We Do</h2>
      <p>DogeKing provides comprehensive guides, tutorials, and market analysis for meme coin enthusiasts. From beginner tutorials on setting up your first Solana wallet to advanced trading strategies, we cover everything you need to navigate the meme coin ecosystem.</p>
      <h2>Our Mission</h2>
      <p>We believe in democratizing access to meme coin knowledge. The crypto space moves fast, and our goal is to help you stay informed, avoid common pitfalls, and make smarter trading decisions.</p>
      <h2>Disclaimer</h2>
      <p>The content on DogeKing is for informational and educational purposes only. It does not constitute financial advice. Always do your own research (DYOR) before investing in any cryptocurrency.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
